  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the numbers be <math><mtext>a</mtext><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mtext>ar</mtext><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mtext>ar</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mtext>ar</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></msup></math> ,<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math> are in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />So, the numbers are <math><mo>–</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>–</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>–</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>–</mo><mn>24</mn></math>",
